{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Dream-Chasing Window Cleaner x Action-Adventure</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Experience a thrilling action-packed adventure as a window cleaner navigating the towering skyscrapers of the city.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Chase your dreams, face harsh realities, and carve out Sky\u2019s future.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Thrilling Cleaning Action</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Utilize wires and skills to swiftly and precisely clean buildings.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >But be careful\u2014one slip could lead to a deadly fall. Overcome hazards like birds, lightning strikes, strong winds, and many many more as you aim for top performance.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2387430/extras/68cf2af0fca2bfaebf6f3608a468bdad.poster.avif?t=1754300229\" width=768 height=432 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2387430/extras/68cf2af0fca2bfaebf6f3608a468bdad.webm?t=1754300229\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2387430/extras/68cf2af0fca2bfaebf6f3608a468bdad.mp4?t=1754300229\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Manage Your Money and Well-being</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Taxes, rent, medical bills\u2014survive day by day while managing your limited income.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Overworking takes a toll on your body. Rest and entertainment are key to maintaining balance in your daily life.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2387430/extras/ba07ec8cbe3b32aaf45e01fc9a4b9308.poster.avif?t=1754300229\" width=768 height=432 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2387430/extras/ba07ec8cbe3b32aaf45e01fc9a4b9308.webm?t=1754300229\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2387430/extras/ba07ec8cbe3b32aaf45e01fc9a4b9308.mp4?t=1754300229\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Upgrade Skills &amp; Equipment</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Enhance your cleaning tools and unlock abilities through the Skill Synapse skill tree.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Build the optimal setup and clean more efficiently.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2387430/extras/d052833b9d81f70f67c77ff688141079.poster.avif?t=1754300229\" width=768 height=432 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2387430/extras/d052833b9d81f70f67c77ff688141079.webm?t=1754300229\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2387430/extras/d052833b9d81f70f67c77ff688141079.mp4?t=1754300229\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Sky\u2019s Life Changes with Your Choices</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The story unfolds across five different scenarios, each with unique characters and settings.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Overcome challenges, interact with people, and help Sky find his true path.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2014If you reach for the sky, one day you\u2019ll touch it.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Shape Sky\u2019s future with your own hands.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2387430/extras/65e2f4cacc8dc823f97a23175da861ae.avif?t=1754300229\" width=576 height=324 /></span></p>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"The First Step","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2387430/ba503671c3b2df3cdb3386b2c01ebe540be1b97f.jpg"},{"name":"Work in Progress","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2387430/ba503671c3b2df3cdb3386b2c01ebe540be1b97f.jpg"},{"name":"A Summer's Memory","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2387430/ba503671c3b2df3cdb3386b2c01ebe540be1b97f.jpg"},{"name":"The Underworld","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2387430/ba503671c3b2df3cdb3386b2c01ebe540be1b97f.jpg"},{"name":"Awakened Harmony","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2387430/ba503671c3b2df3cdb3386b2c01ebe540be1b97f.jpg"},{"name":"Unfulfilled Dreams","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2387430/ba503671c3b2df3cdb3386b2c01ebe540be1b97f.jpg"},{"name":"Limitless Possibilities","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2387430/4e86c97df386bda9b06fc0969b8756b3183b2e3f.jpg"},{"name":"Fully Accomplished","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2387430/4e86c97df386bda9b06fc0969b8756b3183b2e3f.jpg"},{"name":"Folly of Youth","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2387430/4e86c97df386bda9b06fc0969b8756b3183b2e3f.jpg"},{"name":"The Harsh Underworld","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2387430/4e86c97df386bda9b06fc0969b8756b3183b2e3f.jpg"}],"total":44},"background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/2387430?t=1754300229","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/2387430?t=1754300229","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2387430/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1754300229","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2387430/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1754300229","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Custom Volume Controls","id":68},{"description":"Adjustable Difficulty","id":78},{"description":"Keyboard Only Option","id":75},{"description":"Playable without Timed Input","id":74},{"description":"Stereo Sound","id":69},{"description":"Partial Controller Support","id":18},{"description":"Steam Cloud","id":23},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[5],"notes":"Drinking Alcohol, Smoking"},"demos":[{"appid":2500520,"description":""}],"detailed_description":"<h1>BUZZ</h1><p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >&quot;This building-cleaning action game will change the way you interpret reality&quot; - <i>IGN Japan</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >&quot;A game that depicts the struggles of young people during their pursuit of their dreams&quot; - <i>Game*Spark</i></p></p><br><h1>About the Game</h1><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Dream-Chasing Window Cleaner x Action-Adventure</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Experience a thrilling action-packed adventure as a window cleaner navigating the towering skyscrapers of the city.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Chase your dreams, face harsh realities, and carve out Sky\u2019s future.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Thrilling Cleaning Action</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Utilize wires and skills to swiftly and precisely clean buildings.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >But be careful\u2014one slip could lead to a deadly fall. Overcome hazards like birds, lightning strikes, strong winds, and many many more as you aim for top performance.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2387430/extras/68cf2af0fca2bfaebf6f3608a468bdad.poster.avif?t=1754300229\" width=768 height=432 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2387430/extras/68cf2af0fca2bfaebf6f3608a468bdad.webm?t=1754300229\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2387430/extras/68cf2af0fca2bfaebf6f3608a468bdad.mp4?t=1754300229\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Manage Your Money and Well-being</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Taxes, rent, medical bills\u2014survive day by day while managing your limited income.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Overworking takes a toll on your body. Rest and entertainment are key to maintaining balance in your daily life.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2387430/extras/ba07ec8cbe3b32aaf45e01fc9a4b9308.poster.avif?t=1754300229\" width=768 height=432 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2387430/extras/ba07ec8cbe3b32aaf45e01fc9a4b9308.webm?t=1754300229\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2387430/extras/ba07ec8cbe3b32aaf45e01fc9a4b9308.mp4?t=1754300229\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Upgrade Skills &amp; Equipment</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Enhance your cleaning tools and unlock abilities through the Skill Synapse skill tree.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Build the optimal setup and clean more efficiently.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2387430/extras/d052833b9d81f70f67c77ff688141079.poster.avif?t=1754300229\" width=768 height=432 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2387430/extras/d052833b9d81f70f67c77ff688141079.webm?t=1754300229\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2387430/extras/d052833b9d81f70f67c77ff688141079.mp4?t=1754300229\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Sky\u2019s Life Changes with Your Choices</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The story unfolds across five different scenarios, each with unique characters and settings.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Overcome challenges, interact with people, and help Sky find his true path.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2014If you reach for the sky, one day you\u2019ll touch it.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Shape Sky\u2019s future with your own hands.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2387430/extras/65e2f4cacc8dc823f97a23175da861ae.avif?t=1754300229\" width=576 height=324 /></span></p>","developers":["Ryo Kobuchi"],"genres":[{"description":"Action","id":"1"},{"description":"Adventure","id":"25"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2387430/header.jpg?t=1754300229","is_free":false,"legal_notice":"\u00a9 2025 Ryo Kobuchi. All rights reserved.","linux_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> Ubuntu 16.04 LTS or SteamOS<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Intel Core i3-4130 or AMD FX-4100<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 4 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> NVIDIA GeForce GTX 660 or AMD Radeon HD 7870, OpenGL 3.3 compatible<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 1 GB available space</li></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> Ubuntu 18.04 LTS or SteamOS<br></li><li><strong>Process